#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**U gate**\n"
msgstr "**U Gate**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*(Previously called the U3 gate)* The three parameters allow the "
"construction of any single-qubit gate. Has a duration of one unit of gate "
"time.\n"
msgstr ""
"*(이전에는 U3 Gate라고 불렸습니다)* 세 개의 매개변수를 통해 단일 qubit Gate를 임의로 구성할 수 있습니다. Gate "
"시간 한 단위의 지속 시간을 갖습니다.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Composer reference                                   | OpenQASM reference         | Q-sphere | Note about q-sphere representations                                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n"
"| ---------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| ![u\\_gate](/docs/images/guides/composer/628ae112-fcf8-4be7-a04b-568c390f7c4d.avif) | `u(theta, phi, lam) q[0];` | ![u3\\_qsph](/docs/images/guides/composer/3e5212aa-a78c-48d8-b49a-4af362e5b899.avif)                            | The q-sphere representation shows the state after the gate operates on the initial equal superposition state $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2^{n}}}\\sum_{i=0}^{2^{n}-1}\\vert i\\rangle, $ where $n$ is the number of qubits needed to support the gate. |\n"
msgstr ""
